                {
                    "id": "015310bf-b71d-4bf0-9a38-d748fb54f648",
                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                    "args": {
                        "text": [
                            "Inside us there\nare relics of\nworlds",
                            "we explored once.",
                            "Worlds not\nentirely\nforgotten,",
                            "that reappear in\nthe form of\nrapid emotions",
                            "or unpleasant\ngestures.",
                            "Sometimes we\nmanage to part\nwith them",
                            "without remorse or\npain, but much\nmore often",
                            "we are forced to\nrelive them",
                            "until they are\ncompletely\nabsorbed.",
                            "I don't remember\nall my worlds,",
                            "but some of them\ncome back to visit\nme sometimes..."
                        ],
                        "avatarId": "",
                        "__collapse": true,
                        "__comment": false
                    }
                },
